1
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:29,337
Every time the rain no longer
falls, and I see the sky,

2
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,297
I think back to when I was a child.

3
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,937
Who could only cry?

4
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,597
Blindly chasing after him,

5
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:42,317
I fell far behind my only thought.

6
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:45,437
One day I will be stronger.

7
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,897
Bridery and gratitude.

8
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,517
Fading with the wind.

9
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,337
Am I stronger now than I was before?

10
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:55,297
Or as weak as back then?

11
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,397
I don't know for sure.

12
00:00:57,480 --> 00:01:01,157
But until I do, my voyage will not end.

13
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:06,340
No matter what's next, I'm
walking straight ahead.

14
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:12,577
So let's go, there's nothing
that can stop us now.

15
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:17,560
Those times are on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

16
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:22,577
And we may fall, but we'll
always keep on standing.

17
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:28,697
There's no way anything will take
what I hold dear away from me.

18
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:33,657
The voices inside me push
me to keep surviving.

19
00:01:33,740 --> 00:01:39,257
I'll go on, I'll get through,
no matter what I gotta do.

20
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:43,177
The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.

21
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:48,720
I don't care why in the
world would I turn back?

22
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:54,257
So let's go.

23
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:57,897
There's nothing that can stop us now.

24
00:01:57,980 --> 00:02:02,837
Though time's not on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

25
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,917
And we may fall.

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,837
But we'll always keep on standing.

27
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:14,097
There's no way anything will take
what I hope you're away from me?

28
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:17,620
I know the future's there for us to see.

29
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:33,257
We're up against him too,
the legendary hero god.

30
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:36,597
We didn't make it all the
way here just to lose.

31
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:41,357
To an old man, legends
ain't nothing but words.

32
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:46,860
I might say the same
thing to you. White beard.

33
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:51,120
Your glory days are
just a dying memory now!

34
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:53,420
Oh, please!

35
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:04,520
Damn, are you gonna
destroy this entire city?

36
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,487
Send me the bill for
repairs when we're done.

37
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:13,120
Keep pushing toward the scavenger!

38
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:24,244
Ironic, I know, but I
forgot about those things.

39
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:27,540
No more lasers for today. That's enough!

40
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,797
Did you think we were weak, please?

41
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:32,580
We're from the new world!

42
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,780
Now's our chance!

43
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,276
Get to the scaffold!

44
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:03,360
A final moment of regret?

45
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,270
Poor boy.

46
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:20,820
Gold Roger?

47
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,701
Yeah, of course I know who he is.

48
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,720
But who gives a crap?

49
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:30,497
People talk like he's something
special, but what did he even do?

50
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:32,737
He just riled up a bunch of criminals.

51
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:35,957
And thanks to that bastard,
the entire world is screwed up.

52
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,257
And what does that mean?

53
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:39,137
There's no way you're that stupid.

54
00:04:39,220 --> 00:04:41,077
Everyone knows before he was executed,

55
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:43,317
he told some BS story
about hidden treasure

56
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,977
to give the middle
finger to the government.

57
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:45,980
But either way,

58
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:47,010
it worked,

59
00:04:47,093 --> 00:04:50,117
because a bunch of dumb pirates bought
into the whole thing and went nuts.

60
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,097
Don't you get it?

61
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:53,897
He left behind a stain
people still can't clean up.

62
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:56,274
Even killing the bastard wasn't enough.

63
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:57,357
Now, thanks to him,

64
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:59,197
we gotta put up with a
bunch of human garbage

65
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,657
pissing on everyone
else following his lead.

66
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:04,446
He's the biggest piece
of crap who ever lived.

67
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,400
He stinks even after we flushed him.

68
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:08,920
Just like you, kid.

69
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:13,690
Huh?

70
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:19,357
Oh, did I hurt your wittle feelings?

71
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,205
Are you in the Roger fan club?

72
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,694
You got something you want to say, kid?

73
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,880
You start in trouble again, Ace?

74
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:41,740
What was it this time?

75
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:49,007
Everyone's making a fuss about some thugs
that got beat near to death by a kid.

76
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:52,797
That's too bad I was
hoping they would die.

77
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:55,917
Don't give me that you
realize when you pull this

78
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,357
kind of crap I'm the one
who gets chewed out for it.

79
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,270
Right.

80
00:05:59,353 --> 00:06:00,217
Hey are you listening?

81
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:04,377
Honestly I don't know what that old fool

82
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:06,537
was thinking leaving a
boy like you with me.

83
00:06:06,620 --> 00:06:09,957
What you want me to tell you about Roger?

84
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:16,437
He was

85
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,350
a liar

86
00:06:17,433 --> 00:06:18,357
and a murderer

87
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,377
and a miserable thief to boot.

88
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:22,857
Only jackasses believe his crap.

89
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,737
King of the pirates king of the chumps.

90
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,650
He's dead.

91
00:06:25,733 --> 00:06:26,960
Either way got that right.

92
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:33,157
Roger huh?

93
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:36,217
I'm trying to enjoy a drink over here kid.

94
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,677
The man was a hack.

95
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,940
Now piss off.

96
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:42,000
You hear me? Beat it, kid.

97
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,090
Hey!

98
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:48,024
What do you think you're
doing, you little punk?

99
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,440
I should see the other guy, right?

100
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,677
Look, Ace.

101
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,760
You can't keep doing this, kiddo.

102
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:14,120
So your grandson

103
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,540
He's around my age, huh?

104
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:20,820
Do you think he's happy with himself?

105
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:23,717
Luffy, I think he is.

106
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,480
The boy's growing up in fine feather.

107
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,360
Old man Yeah

108
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,440
Tell me the truth.

109
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:40,020
Did I deserve to be born
or was it just a mistake?

110
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,617
That's not for me to say.

111
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:51,640
You just keep living
and hope you find out.

112
00:07:58,340 --> 00:08:00,660
Quick carry straw boy back to the ship!

113
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:05,251
It's not ideal, but we'll have
to save Ace Boy without him.

114
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:08,890
Eva

115
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,600
Calm down, take it easy.

116
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:18,320
I need one last favor from you.

117
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:23,777
We're coming for you, Ace.

118
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:25,357
We're taking you home.

119
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:27,700
And Amy never stood a chance.

120
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:31,500
This is wrong.

121
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:43,717
My friend, don't lose hope.

122
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:47,397
I swear, I shall save your life no
matter how much blood it's filled.

123
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,237
We're almost there.

124
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,820
There's no stopping us now.

125
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:57,737
Don't let them get you down, Ace.

126
00:08:57,820 --> 00:08:59,897
Yeah, we won't leave you.

127
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:01,980
We're brothers, we stick together.

128
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,637
Damn it, this is all wrong.

129
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:09,060
How the hell am I supposed to feel?

130
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:11,777
Pops, Luffy, my friends?

131
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:13,717
They're here to save me, but!

132
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:16,657
They're pushing through a sea
of their own blood to do it.

133
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:18,777
Don't say one last anything!

134
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:21,272
We're getting out of here alive, darn it!

135
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:25,100
You know what I need?

136
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:28,080
I'm sick.

137
00:09:29,060 --> 00:09:31,260
These are tears of joy.

138
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,597
Even after all I've done?

139
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:38,840
I want to live!

140
00:09:44,540 --> 00:09:46,057
Captain Buggy?

141
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:47,037
He's awake.

142
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,277
He's alive.

143
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,160
I knew it all along.

144
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:53,540
Aw, jeez, what happened? We okay?

145
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,437
Aokiji just froze you solid.

146
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,755
It was really freaky.

147
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:06,400
Oh, no!

148
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,300
You hear that, Navy?

149
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:15,180
Buggy's coming for you.

150
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:19,317
No walls, eyes, or giant magma
fists can stop me. Awesome!

151
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,937
You've only been defrosted
like a couple of minutes,

152
00:10:22,020 --> 00:10:23,537
but you're like BAM let's do it.

153
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:24,620
That's how I roll

154
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:31,140
Okay, seriously now what
better move my punk?

155
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:46,940
Son of a

156
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,077
The ravages of time humble us all.

157
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,157
Yes, even you.

158
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,037
Screw the fight.

159
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,826
This is what I was afraid of.

160
00:11:01,780 --> 00:11:03,457
I don't want no sympathy.

161
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:06,537
There's no way I'm wearing this
crap in front of my enemies!

162
00:11:06,620 --> 00:11:08,337
Damn it, pops.

163
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:12,660
Wouldn't turn your back
on me if I were you.

164
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:21,300
You're gonna make the same mistake.

165
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:36,780
Someone has to see you off and that
duty seems to have fallen on me.

166
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:48,220
Pops, no!

167
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:52,960
Oh, got good. Oh, crap.

168
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:55,500
Another hormone shot?

169
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,960
Do you want to die?

170
00:11:57,700 --> 00:11:59,340
You're past your limit.

171
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:04,880
I'm sorry, kid, but you've been burning
your candle at both ends for too long.

172
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,957
Have you forgotten that
poison you suffered through?

173
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,257
You cheated death once.

174
00:12:09,340 --> 00:12:12,164
I didn't save you so you
could destroy yourself.

175
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:14,189
I told you this last time.

176
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:18,817
My hormones aren't a magic fix-me-up you
can take every time something goes wrong.

177
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:21,135
I want to save Ace Boy, just like you.

178
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:24,634
But if you keep misusing my
power like this, you'll die.

179
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:33,860
As long as I do everything I can.

180
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,360
I don't care if I die.

181
00:12:40,980 --> 00:12:43,540
I'm begging you, you have to let me fight.

182
00:12:48,900 --> 00:12:50,757
Guys, I think Pops is down.

183
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,400
Marco, Geoise.

184
00:12:54,540 --> 00:12:56,440
If I don't keep fighting!

185
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:01,240
And they kill Ace because
I wasn't there for him?

186
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:05,180
Then I'd rather be dead anyway.

187
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,617
Right now?

188
00:13:08,700 --> 00:13:11,700
How is the only fight
that matters? Live or die!

189
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:18,540
You dummy!

190
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,637
Whatever would I tell your dear old dad,

191
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:24,277
Dragon, if I let you die like a dog
due to my deadly Devil Fruit power?

192
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:27,066
This stubbornness of
yours is not cute at all!

193
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:33,110
Ace.

194
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:44,440
Oh fine, it's your life
give us a good show

195
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,300
Wait, what are you doing?

196
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,680
He's got back up.

197
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:11,820
No way.

198
00:14:12,260 --> 00:14:13,577
Kizaru hit him dead on.

199
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:18,189
It's a miracle he's even alive, let
alone getting up and screaming like that.

200
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:22,050
Luffy.

201
00:14:28,540 --> 00:14:32,600
Remember, Straw Boy, energy
hormone may get you pumped for now.

202
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,940
But if you fall again, that's it.

203
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,720
You're a dead boy. Got it?

204
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:40,380
Crap, it's happening.

205
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:49,220
Hold on a sec.

206
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,791
You're not executing Ace while I'm around.

207
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:52,877
The kid's crazy,

208
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:57,313
but it isn't like he's going to change
his mind under these circumstances.

209
00:14:58,100 --> 00:15:00,357
Yes, I might as well give
him some backup then.

210
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:02,180
Hold on, Straw Boy!

211
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,700
He was coming for you!

212
00:15:04,060 --> 00:15:05,200
He's over there!

213
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:07,220
Straw Hat's still alive!

214
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,840
Not for long, he's not!

215
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,000
I'll finish him off!

216
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:33,780
Enough crap.

217
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:36,257
You're not taking another step.

218
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,817
We've got you surrounded now.

219
00:15:37,900 --> 00:15:40,277
Yeah, he's right, there's no
way you can defeat all of us.

220
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,997
The navy always wins.

221
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,700
You might as well give up.

222
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:54,590
Incoming!

223
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:55,910
Death!

224
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,150
We?

225
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:03,000
My, what a fanciful strike.

226
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,473
Thanks, Eva, I owe you.

227
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:20,710
Kobe!

228
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,000
All right, focus.

229
00:16:28,540 --> 00:16:31,540
If I want any hope of
growing stronger as a Marine,

230
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:36,039
I have to fight all enemies,
no matter who they are.

231
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,340
This is war.

232
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:44,020
I'm sorry, Luffy, but I'm
gonna have to kill you.

233
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:54,320
Now save!

234
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:10,840
Looks like I got carried away again.

235
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,220
I'm useless after all.

236
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,856
I guess it's back to the truck, Bart.

237
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,740
I knew again!

238
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:28,040
Those dirty frauds
impersonating my friend!

239
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,100
Monkey D. Luffy.

240
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,800
Why can't they just move?!

241
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:48,898
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

242
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:52,940
Boa Hancock, one of the seven warlords.

243
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,160
Navy ally detected.

244
00:17:56,620 --> 00:17:58,500
Ceasing attack. Oh, yeah.

245
00:17:58,740 --> 00:18:00,297
You guys are on the same side.

246
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,792
Thanks a bunch, Hancock.

247
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,497
Isn't that the pirate, Empress?

248
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,977
Have you two got a thing
going on I should know about?

249
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:09,040
He said it.

250
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:12,897
He said my name, and he didn't
get it wrong. Please move.

251
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:15,957
You are standing in the
way I never gave you

252
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:18,511
permission to address me in such a matter.

253
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:33,500
Hold on, Pops, coming to save you!

254
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:38,180
It went straight through.

255
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,960
Yeah, just try and stop me?

256
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:45,897
Well, that certainly throws
a wrinkle into my plan.

257
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:47,039
Regeneration, huh?

258
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:49,920
So that must be why they
call you the Phoenix.

259
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:52,440
Hey, give me a hand, will you?

260
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,420
Sea Prism Stone?

261
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:14,240
Oh, it hurt that time, huh?

262
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:17,160
They got Geoise too.

263
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:19,020
He's frozen solid.

264
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:24,580
That's two commanders down.

265
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:26,114
What should we do now?

266
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,320
Take out the head and
the body will follow.

267
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:38,920
He's in danger.

268
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,137
Hold still, you monster!

269
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:43,877
You fool, I will not be chained.

270
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:45,840
Good, now close in fast!

271
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:50,409
Against the others and attack
quite big with all you've got.

272
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:12,040
We'll save him!

273
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:13,980
No, stay back!

274
00:20:17,540 --> 00:20:22,540
You punks really think that's
all it takes to defeat me?

275
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:28,320
Just a few toy swords and guns?

276
00:20:31,260 --> 00:20:37,280
I could tear you all apart single-handedly,
but you know that, don't you?

277
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:44,040
Because you quake when you
hear the name Whitebeard!

278
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:03,190
No,

279
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:05,200
no, no, no, no,

280
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:11,500
no,

281
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:18,740
no.

282
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:38,700
That's insane!

283
00:21:49,940 --> 00:21:53,080
I'm not such a fool.

284
00:21:55,840 --> 00:22:00,100
I know what will happen if
I falter, even for a moment.

285
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:03,200
What will happen if I die?

286
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:12,300
And knowing that cold truth

287
00:22:13,180 --> 00:22:15,717
I can't allow myself to submit!

288
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:18,380
Not until the bitter end

289
00:22:20,860 --> 00:22:25,220
So I'll wait until I've taken
care of the future for my sons?

290
00:22:33,100 --> 00:22:35,140
Got it, Ace.

291
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:40,860
Oh, Pops.

292
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:49,800
Ah, old fools lost it.

293
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:53,280
What the hell?

294
00:22:58,660 --> 00:23:00,600
Damn, and we were so close, too?

295
00:23:01,360 --> 00:23:04,057
Bastards have formed a barrier
around Whitebeard's back!

296
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:06,820
You want us to bury you with the old man?

297
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:11,100
Your mockery does not sway my honor.

298
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:16,280
It is our pride and our
joy to stand beside him!

299
00:23:19,220 --> 00:23:21,037
You bunch of fools!

300
00:23:21,120 --> 00:23:22,580
Get away.

301
00:23:23,140 --> 00:23:24,477
Concerned about the future?

302
00:23:24,560 --> 00:23:27,037
I'll be more than happy
to show it to you now.

303
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:28,160
Let's end this.

304
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:29,560
Execute him!

305
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,700
Ace, go!

306
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:40,100
I'm too slow!

307
00:23:41,620 --> 00:23:43,180
Don't make me laugh!

308
00:23:43,740 --> 00:23:46,940
You think I can't stop
those ruts from doing it?

309
00:23:54,260 --> 00:23:57,140
From the start, this was the only way!

310
00:24:00,980 --> 00:24:01,810
Yes!

311
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,340
Don't do it!

312
00:24:36,300 --> 00:24:38,880
Don't you dare!

313
00:25:17,080 --> 00:25:19,300
It's not over yet!

314
00:25:20,700 --> 00:25:22,880
Did you just do what I think you did?

315
00:25:23,120 --> 00:25:25,500
It's the Conqueror's spirit.

316
00:25:27,460 --> 00:25:28,580
Well, damn.

317
00:25:28,940 --> 00:25:30,000
This is a mess.

318
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:34,480
There's a surprise for you.

319
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:47,040
Why that little brat?

320
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:54,660
AAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!
